  "headline": "Skjothendi the Unerring guide (God of War Ragnarok): prevent Bifrost snowball with short confirms",
  "description": "Skjothendi is a Bifrost snowball fight. Prioritize preventing buildup, take only short confirms, and reset spacing aggressively.",
  "keywords": [
    "skjothendi the unerring guide",
    "berserker",
    "bifrost",
    "niflheim",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\n- Bifrost buildup snowballing into a collapse\n- aerial drops and fast entries breaking rhythm\n\n2) Prep\n- lock short runics\n- commit to a reset-first mindset after any messy exchange\n\n3) Fixed plan\n1) dodge Bifrost-inflicting actions first\n2) punish once, then disengage\n3) if buildup risk rises, create space and reset\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- post-landing recovery\n- post-special recovery\n- end of gap-closers\n\nRelated: check the all-Berserkers index for gravestone location and order.",
